1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:02,650
[FLUORESCENT LIGHTS HUMMING]

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:05,550
[PA] Good evening, and welcome to the night shift.

3
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:07,596
(whispering) Okay. First night.

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:12,045
[PA] Rule one. The humming of the lights is normal.

5
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:17,558
[PA] Rule two. You are the only employee on this floor.

6
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:27,100
[PA] Rule three. If the lights flicker three times, do not look at the ceiling.

7
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:29,100
[LIGHTS FLICKER]

8
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:35,650
Hello?

9
00:00:36,050 --> 00:00:37,350
[TAPE NOISE]

10
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:39,805
It was midnight a second ago.

11
00:00:40,400 --> 00:00:44,030
[PA] Rule four. There are no exits on this floor.

12
00:00:44,030 --> 00:00:46,750
If you see an exit sign, do not follow it.

13
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:47,850
[SILENCE]

14
00:00:47,950 --> 00:00:49,850
That's an exit.

15
00:00:53,050 --> 00:00:54,981
[PA] Rule six.
